From d3b2f6a3f3c5c3104ad696ae71f4abf9ec920ab7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 13:26:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www: language packs for this rung (25 dictionaries in
 lockstep)

New and corrected tokens for the IPv6 pages, the DNS Failover IPv6 status line
and switches, the Firewall apply states, the Wi-Fi setup hint and the Wireless
table heading; a full-firmware sweep of cross-pack copies, homoglyphs and tokens
borrowed across domains. Every pack carries the same keys.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
